---
description: Wixmo API integration rules
globs: ["**/*.php"]
---

This plugin integrates with the Wixmo API.

Rules:

- Do NOT break existing Wixmo integration
- Reuse existing API classes and services
- Do NOT create duplicate API layers

- Respect:
  - Authentication flow
  - Request structure
  - Response handling

- Only modify Wixmo-related code when explicitly required

- Keep API logic separated from:
  - UI
  - WooCommerce presentation logic

- Add logging carefully when needed
- Handle API errors predictably

- Always analyze existing implementation before making changes

- Maintain backward compatibility